&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6sense&#39;s mission is to multiply what matters: growth, retention, and efficiency.&amp;nbsp; We envision a future where companies, teams and people reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our People:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People are the heart and soul of 6sense. We serve with passion and purpose. We live by our Being 6sense values of Win as One Team, Stay Curious, Do The Right Thing, Own the Outcome, and Create Belonging. &amp;nbsp;Every 6sensor plays a part in deﬁning the future of our industry-leading technology.&amp;nbsp; 6sense is a place where difference-makers roll up their sleeves, take risks, act with integrity, and measure success by the value we create for our customers.&amp;nbsp; We want 6sense to be the best chapter of your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Associate Campaign Operations Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Campaign&amp;nbsp;Operations team in Pune. The role will support the execution, monitoring, troubleshooting,&amp;nbsp;and optimization of &lt;strong&gt;digital advertising, programmatic, and social (Omni-Channel)&amp;nbsp;campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience with campaign operations,&amp;nbsp;optimization, troubleshooting, audience management, campaign analytics, and&amp;nbsp;advertising/marketing technology platforms. Experience with &lt;strong&gt;DSPs/SSP’s such as Xandr&amp;nbsp;(AppNexus), Beeswax, DV360, CM360, Centro, The Trade Desk, GAM, OpenX, and&amp;nbsp;Pubmatic&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Automation Platforms such as HubSpot, Marketo, Eloqua,&amp;nbsp;Mailchimp, or Constant Contact&lt;/strong&gt; is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a high degree of individual ownership and accountability, with the ability&amp;nbsp;to independently manage day-to-day campaign operations, troubleshoot and resolve issues,&amp;nbsp;support Go-to-Market teams, and collaborate effectively with Product, Engineering, Sales,&amp;nbsp;and Customer Success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 2+ years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;Programmatic/Digital Advertising, AdTech, Campaign&amp;nbsp;Operations, Programmatic Advertising, Marketing Operations, or Email Marketing.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Hands-on experience with&lt;strong&gt; DSPs, MAPs, CRMs, or similar advertising/marketing&amp;nbsp;platforms.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Understanding of campaign setup, targeting, audience segmentation, budgets,&amp;nbsp;pacing, bidding, scheduling, creatives, tracking, and delivery.&lt;br&gt;• Experience monitoring campaign performance, optimization and troubleshooting&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;under-delivery, pacing, targeting, creative, configuration, and tracking issues.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Understanding of digital advertising metrics such as &lt;strong&gt;impressions, clicks, CTR, CPM,&amp;nbsp;CPC, conversions, CPA, reach, frequency, and ROI.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience creating, launching, monitoring, optimizing and reporting on&lt;strong&gt; email and&amp;nbsp;demand-generation campaigns.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience with CRM/MAP platforms such as &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce, HubSpot, Marketo, Eloqua,&amp;nbsp;Mailchimp,&lt;/strong&gt; or similar.&lt;br&gt;• Strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Excel/Google Sheets,&lt;/strong&gt; including Pivot Tables,&amp;nbsp;XLOOKUP/VLOOKUP, data cleansing, analysis, and reporting.&lt;br&gt;• Basic knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;HTML5, email HTML, ad creative specifications, tracking pixels,&amp;nbsp;UTM parameters, and landing-page troubleshooting.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to identify trends,&amp;nbsp;anomalies, and optimization opportunities.&lt;br&gt;• Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;ABM and intent-based marketing &lt;/strong&gt;is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Operations &amp;amp; Troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Manage day-to-day operations for &lt;strong&gt;digital advertising, programmatic, and social&amp;nbsp;(Omni-Channel) campaigns.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Review and validate campaign setup, targeting, budgets, schedules, creatives,&amp;nbsp;tracking, and other configurations.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor active campaigns for &lt;strong&gt;delivery, pacing, performance, and operational issues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;and take corrective action.&lt;br&gt;• Identify campaigns that have not delivered impressions or email workflows that have&amp;nbsp;not executed within defined thresholds.&lt;br&gt;• Review campaign performance and recommend optimization opportunities.&lt;br&gt;• Troubleshoot campaign, creative, tracking, and platform issues and work with&amp;nbsp;DSP/MAP partners to resolve them.&lt;br&gt;• Troubleshoot &lt;strong&gt;creative audit failures &lt;/strong&gt;and coordinate resolution with relevant&amp;nbsp;platform teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market &amp;amp; Customer Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Respond to &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce tickets, Slack requests, emails, and other support channels&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;from Sales, Customer Success, and Go-to-Market teams.&lt;br&gt;• Support CSMs with &lt;strong&gt;customer onboarding, campaign setup, ad specifications,&amp;nbsp;platform functionality, and campaign-related questions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Translate customer requirements into clear campaign and operational requirements.&lt;br&gt;• Provide timely updates and escalate complex technical or product issues with&amp;nbsp;appropriate documentation.&lt;br&gt;• Identify recurring challenges and recommend improvements to campaign processes&amp;nbsp;and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Partner with &lt;strong&gt;Product, Engineering, Sales, Customer Success, and external platform&amp;nbsp;partners &lt;/strong&gt;to resolve operational and technical issues.&lt;br&gt;• Document product and feature requests with relevant business context and&amp;nbsp;customer use cases.&lt;br&gt;• Participate in testing and validation of new features, campaign workflows, and&amp;nbsp;operational processes.&lt;br&gt;• Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;root-cause analysis, process improvements, and operational&amp;nbsp;efficiency.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create and maintain &lt;strong&gt;troubleshooting guides, FAQs, and training materials.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Support training and knowledge-sharing sessions for Sales and Customer Success&amp;nbsp;teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Review and validate digital ad creatives against campaign and platform&amp;nbsp;specifications.&lt;br&gt;• Create, modify, test, or troubleshoot creatives when required.&lt;br&gt;• Coordinate creative requirements with internal teams, customers, and platform&amp;nbsp;partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;BE/BTech/BS or equivalent bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/strong&gt; in Computer Science, Engineering, IT,&amp;nbsp;Business Analytics, Marketing Technology, or a related field.&lt;br&gt;• 2–6 years of relevant experience in &lt;strong&gt;Digital Advertising, AdTech, Campaign&amp;nbsp;Operations, Programmatic, Marketing Operations, or Email Marketing.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;campaign execution, monitoring, troubleshooting,&amp;nbsp;optimization, and reporting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Experience working with at least one &lt;strong&gt;DSP, SSP, MAP, CRM, or advertising technology platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Strong analytical skills and attention to detail.&lt;br&gt;• Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Excel/Google Sheets&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Ability to work independently and collaborate effectively with cross-functional&amp;nbsp;teams.&lt;br&gt;• Strong ownership, problem-solving, and process-oriented mindset.&lt;br&gt;• Willingness to work in &lt;strong&gt;rotational shifts&lt;/strong&gt; based on business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Xandr (AppNexus), Beeswax, Campaign Manager 260, DV360,&amp;nbsp;Centro, The Trade Desk, Openx, Google Ad Manager, Pubmaticor&lt;/strong&gt; similar DSPs,&lt;br&gt;• Experience with &lt;strong&gt;6sense, GA4, Salesforce, HubSpot, Marketo, Eloqua, Mailchimp&lt;/strong&gt;, or&amp;nbsp;similar platforms.&lt;br&gt;• Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;ABM, intent data, email deliverability, SPF/DKIM/DMARC&lt;/strong&gt;, and digital&amp;nbsp;advertising standards.&lt;br&gt;• Experience with &lt;strong&gt;HTML5, ad tags, pixels, tracking URLs, or creative troubleshooting.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Looker, Tableau, Power BI, SQL, APIs, scripting, or process&amp;nbsp;automation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience in a &lt;strong&gt;SaaS, AdTech, MarTech, or B2B technology environment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;AdTech, MarTech, data, and customer experience,&lt;/strong&gt; helping&amp;nbsp;ensure campaigns are executed accurately and deliver strong business outcomes. This role&amp;nbsp;offers the opportunity to build expertise across programmatic advertising, email marketing,&amp;nbsp;campaign operations, audience management, and marketing technology while working&amp;nbsp;closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, and Engineering teams.&amp;nbsp;If you are &lt;strong&gt;curious, analytical, detail-oriented, proactive, and passionate about solving&amp;nbsp;problems&lt;/strong&gt;, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Benefits:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Full-time employees can take advantage of health coverage, paid parental leave, generous paid time-off and holidays, quarterly self-care days off, and stock options. We’ll make sure you have the equipment and support you need to work and connect with your teams, at home or in one of our oﬃces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a growth mindset culture that is represented in all that we do, from onboarding through to numerous learning and development initiatives including access to our LinkedIn Learning platform. Employee well-being is also top of mind for us. We host quarterly wellness education sessions to encourage self care and personal growth. From wellness days to ERG-hosted events, we celebrate and energize all 6sense employees and their backgrounds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;6sense is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employers. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. If you require reasonable accommodation in completing this application, interviewing, completing any pre-employment testing, or otherwise participating in the employee selection process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:jobs@6sense.com&quot;&gt;jobs@6sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:jobs@6sense.com&quot;&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;We are aware of recruiting impersonation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;attempts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt; that are not affiliated with 6sense in any way. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;ll email communications from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;6sense&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt; will originate from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;the @6sense.com domain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;We will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;not initially contact you via text message and will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;never request payments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;If you are uncertain whether you have been contacted by an official 6sense employee, reach out to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;mailto:jobs@indeed.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;FieldRange SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;jobs@&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;6sense.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW160271132 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6sense&#39;s mission is to multiply what matters: growth, retention, and efficiency.&amp;nbsp; We envision a future where companies, teams and people reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our People:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People are the heart and soul of 6sense. We serve with passion and purpose. We live by our Being 6sense values of Win as One Team, Stay Curious, Do The Right Thing, Own the Outcome, and Create Belonging. &amp;nbsp;Every 6sensor plays a part in deﬁning the future of our industry-leading technology.&amp;nbsp; 6sense is a place where difference-makers roll up their sleeves, take risks, act with integrity, and measure success by the value we create for our customers.&amp;nbsp; We want 6sense to be the best chapter of your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Benefits Partner &lt;/strong&gt;will administer and improve global benefits programs across the U.S., India, Canada, and the UK. This role manages day-to-day benefits operations, leave administration, open enrollment, vendor coordination, and employee inquiries while partnering with internal teams (People, Payroll, Finance, and Legal), and external vendors to ensure accurate, compliant, and employee-centered delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities &amp;amp; Accountabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead day-to-day administration of global benefits programs, including health and welfare, retirement and pension, leave, wellbeing, eligibility, enrollment, issue resolution, and region-specific offerings across the U.S., India, Canada, and the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee benefits program execution in a shared service HR model (by partnering with People Ops), including escalations, service delivery standards, documentation, controls, audit readiness, and adherence to global governance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer leave programs, including statutory, supplemental, FMLA, state leaves, disability, ADA-related processes, documentation, tracking, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global benefits renewal and annual cycle coordination, including open enrollment, statutory updates, communications, system testing, financial alignment, market competitiveness, and local requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with vendors, brokers, Payroll, Finance, Legal, HR Technology, and People teams on deductions, funding, reconciliations, reporting, cross-border compliance, implementations, and issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with applicable benefits, pension, leave, tax, social insurance, health coverage, data privacy, and jurisdiction-specific regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee benefits systems and vendor performance, including configuration governance, data integrity, access controls, service levels, contract alignment, and process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide reporting and analysis on participation, cost trends, utilization, vendor performance, service metrics, audit findings, and financial impact to inform planning and leadership decisions; perform other duties as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies and Behaviors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational excellence: executes and improves benefits processes accurately, consistently, and with strong attention to controls, metrics, and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee-centered judgment: provides clear, practical, confidential, and empathetic support while balancing business needs and policy requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance mindset: applies sound judgment, maintains documentation, and escalates regulatory, data, financial, or operational risk appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional partnership: collaborates effectively with People, Payroll, Finance, Legal, HR Technology, vendors, brokers, and occasional senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team and change leadership: provides direction, adapts priorities to resource and operational challenges, contributes to standards and budgets, and presents clearly in internal or external forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits transactions, eligibility updates, enrollments, deductions, reconciliations, and inquiries are completed accurately and within service level expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee inquiries, escalations, vendor issues, and leave cases are resolved timely, clearly, and in compliance with applicable requirements across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renewals, open enrollment milestones, statutory updates, testing, communications, reporting, and audits are completed on schedule with minimal errors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor, broker, Payroll, Finance, Legal, HR Technology, and People Team partnerships enable compliant, scalable, and consistent global program execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational and Experience Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of experience in benefits administration, Total Rewards, or a related People function, including global or multi-country benefits exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of U.S. and global benefits regulations, compliance requirements, governance practices, leave programs, and self-insured plan administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with vendors, brokers, Payroll, Finance, Legal, HR Technology, and People teams to resolve escalations, manage renewals, and support service delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, operational discipline, communication skills, employee support mindset, and ability to exercise independent judgment within defined objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with HRIS and benefits platforms preferred, especially Workday benefits administration and U.S. open enrollment; Sequoia, Sparrow, or comparable systems/vendors also valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI tools, automation, reporting, documentation, metrics, and process improvement to improve benefits operations and internal controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CEBS or similar certification, global or SaaS experience, benefits analytics exposure, and experience providing direction to team members preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base Salary Range: $77,919.00 - $114,281.20. The base salary range represents the anticipated low and high end of the base salary range for this position. Actual salaries may vary and may be above or below the range based on various factors, including but not limited to work location and experience. The base salary is one component of 6sense’s total compensation package for this position. Other compensation may include a bonus program or commission plan, and stock options if approved by 6sense’s board. In addition, 6sense provides a variety of benefits, including generous health insurance coverage, life, and disability insurance, a 401K employer matching program, paid holidays, self-care days, and paid time off (PTO). &lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#Li-remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;Notice of Collection and Use of Personal Information for California Residents: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;&quot; href=&quot;https://6sense.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice and Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Benefits:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Full-time employees can take advantage of health coverage, paid parental leave, generous paid time-off and holidays, quarterly self-care days off, and stock options. We’ll make sure you have the equipment and support you need to work and connect with your teams, at home or in one of our oﬃces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a growth mindset culture that is represented in all that we do, from onboarding through to numerous learning and development initiatives including access to our LinkedIn Learning platform. Employee well-being is also top of mind for us. We host quarterly wellness education sessions to encourage self care and personal growth. From wellness days to ERG-hosted events, we celebrate and energize all 6sense employees and their backgrounds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
