&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joint Go-to-Market Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;header&quot;&gt;Build and run co-marketing programs with strategic partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;header&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;from end to end: partner alignment, asset development, campaign execution, field activation, and measurement. Own the pipeline contribution from partner marketing activity and be accountable for reporting it clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[4320,8640],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[0,0]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
