&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Role: Staff Product Manager, Advertising&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a strategic product leader who thrives at the intersection of programmatic advertising, data-driven measurement, and AI-powered go-to-market execution?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 6sense, we are building the most intelligent B2B advertising platform on the market. We are looking for a Staff Product Manager to own the systems, partnerships, and programs that drive advertiser growth, agency adoption, and measurable performance at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact individual contributor role reporting to the Senior Director of Product Management, Advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Staff Product Manager, Advertising, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product roadmap for our SSP integrations and programmatic distribution partnerships, defining segment sync architecture, bidding logic, and publisher-side identity requirements to drive audience activation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the product foundation for 6sense&#39;s agency go-to-market, including workflow, reporting, and campaign management capabilities that meet the expectations of holding company and independent agency buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary product SME for Sales, Customer Success, and Solutions Engineering - creating positioning decks, battlecards, and launch readiness materials that help the field win and retain advertising customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the measurement and attribution strategy for 6sense Advertising, including pixel-based tracking, view-through and click-through attribution, third-party verification integrations, and reporting standards that give advertisers confidence in their investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to embed AI-driven capabilities across the advertiser experience, from predictive audience optimization to automated campaign recommendations and performance anomaly detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the multi-year advertising vision, identify white space in emerging channels, and align executive stakeholders to a cohesive advertising strategy. Mentor junior PMs and raise the bar on documentation and cross-functional execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Strategic Themes You&#39;ll Drive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ensure every advertiser has access to distribution, delivery, and measurement capabilities that are enterprise-grade, transparent, and continuously improving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency and Partner Ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build the infrastructure that makes 6sense the preferred advertising platform for agency buyers and programmatic partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Advertiser Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Embed intelligence into every layer of the advertising workflow - from audience creation to campaign optimization to post-flight measurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advertising Product Mastery. Deep expertise in programmatic advertising, DSP/SSP dynamics, identity resolution, and audience syndication, with a track record of delivering measurable revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM Fluency. Experience building enablement programs, leading launch readiness, and serving as a trusted product partner to Sales and Customer Success in a high-velocity B2B environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurement Depth. Strong command of attribution modeling, third-party verification, pixel infrastructure, and advertiser-facing analytics. You translate data into a compelling product story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI and Emerging Tech Awareness. You track the evolving ad tech landscape and translate trends - agentic buying frameworks, contextual targeting, AI-driven optimization - into defensible product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Communication. You present clear, data-backed strategy to C-suite audiences and drive alignment across sales, finance, and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience. 8-10+ years in Product Management, with at least 4 years in advertising technology, programmatic media, or B2B demand generation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact: You own the product surface that directly drives advertising revenue growth - one of the company&#39;s highest-priority business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope: From SSP distribution architecture to agency-facing UX to AI-powered measurement, this role touches every layer of the advertiser experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence: You will present to and earn buy-in from executive leadership, shape the long-term advertising roadmap, and set the standard for how 6sense Advertising scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth: Join a high-growth organization, learn every day, and accelerate your career in a collaborative, fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun: We take our work seriously, but not ourselves. Expect strong opinions, sharp debate, and the occasional well-timed meme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
